==Battleground==
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cammy (Enemy)|Cammy]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Collecting the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 & 2 will make this stage much easier. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to nuke the Aliens, then spawn in [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] to take care of Cammy herself alongside Bahamut. With good meatshielding, there is hardly anything to worry about here.

